{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】如果你是 Synology NAS 用家，但對自己那部 NAS 的設定一頭霧水，不妨試用這套「synology-nas-cli」開源專案工具。</p><p>它由一位台灣軟體工程師 Sam Lung 編寫，可協助系統管理員與人工智能代理（AI Agent）對 Synology DSM 7 系統進行一鍵安全稽核、漏洞修復與持續監控，全面提升儲存設備的資安防禦水平。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.628729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T16:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:18:07.086428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.772276+00:00","content_hash":"0e9c8e89b0894db7e95865b89e8a53c9e1d00d5c72d77750bb781bf40210f737","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}